1
00:00:00,008 --> 00:00:03,968
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, is the winner of the Physics Bowl
the team that has the most fun?

2
00:00:04,137 --> 00:00:05,767
(Leonard:)Okay. Let me try it this way.

3
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:09,640
You're annoying and no one wants
to play with you anymore.

4
00:00:11,394 --> 00:00:13,064
(Sheldon:)I see.

5
00:00:13,229 --> 00:00:19,399
(Sheldon:)Well, at this point I should inform you
that I intend to form my own team...

6
00:00:19,569 --> 00:00:22,949
(Sheldon:)...and destroy the molecular bonds
that bind your very matter together...

7
00:00:23,114 --> 00:00:27,244
(Sheldon:)...and reduce the resulting
particulate chaos to tears.

8
00:00:28,953 --> 00:00:30,703
(Leonard:)Thanks for the heads up.

9
00:00:31,414 --> 00:00:33,124
(Sheldon:)You're welcome.

10
00:00:34,209 --> 00:00:35,589
(Sheldon:)- One more thing.
- Yes?

11
00:00:35,752 --> 00:00:37,792
(Sheldon:)It's on, bitch.

12
00:00:46,721 --> 00:00:49,811
- So who did he get to be on his team?
- He won't say.

13
00:00:49,974 --> 00:00:53,814
(Leonard:)He just smiles
and eats macaroons out of his Bat-Jar.

14
00:00:54,646 --> 00:00:58,436
(Raj:)He's using psychological warfare.
We must reply in kind.

